Z||000000||deceler8||04-04-2001||05:40 PM||||It's coming. Dimmable sunroofs, windshields, rear view mirrors...<P>How about a windshield that's also the car's dashboard display ?<P>And windows in offices or homes that can be manually or automatically dimmed ?<P>How about flexible laptop or cellphone displays or programmable advertising displays?<P>The company that will be doing all this is Research Frontiers. They're on the NASDAQ at symbol REFR.<BR> <A HREF="http://www.refr-spd.com" TARGET=_blank>www.refr-spd.com</A> <P>Really cool stuff.<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/deceler8_sig.gif"> ||||reg||1
