Z||000002||DaRkLoRD||04-04-2001||06:29 PM||||Electrochromic glass is cool, it's similar to the "smart glass" which can make a window turn frosted with the flick of a switch. it's basically a liquid crystal device, and when electrical current is applied, it shifts the crystals which alters the polarization, allowing less light through.. and giving the effect of the window being tinted. I want some too.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>   <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>   <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A><p>[This message has been edited by DaRkLoRD (edited 04-04-2001).]||||reg||3
